   "options": "Advisory\nBalanced\nStrict\nCustom",
   "default": "Advisory",
   "bold": 1,
   "description": "Advisory: everything warns, nothing blocks — the safe way to start. Balanced: data quality blocks, quantity warns. Strict: everything blocks. Editing any rule below switches this to Custom. Statutory compliance rules always block regardless of preset."
